{"about_the_game":"Synthwave Burnout is an arcade journey designed to give you an enjoyable visual and sound experience. The aesthetics of good old fiction, pleasant, uncomplicated supercar control gameplay - all this is created for you. Feel like you're inside your favorite 80s sci-fi movie!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1693040/extras/313ef7424e26d514df59bd6a77c951e3.avif?t=1758407574\" width=616 height=128 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY FEATURES</h2>Movement is life. In our case, the correct control of the supercar allows its unique generator to extract energy from the surrounding world. <br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1693040/extras/26075802745ef6281dd7279ccde76298.avif?t=1758407574\" width=616 height=128 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CAPTURE A SOUND WAVE</h2>When your supercar picks up the right speed and the wind blows in your face, you won't want to stop. It will be akin to anticipating the future - the sensations that cult films and music of the 80s evoke. You will soon realize that the soundtrack and the movement on the neon-flooded highway make up a single whole.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1693040/extras/c5d125a392a42f84ac040dbdfacb2f14.avif?t=1758407574\" width=616 height=128 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THREE THINGS YOU CAN LOOK AT ENDLESSLY:</h2>How the fire burns, how the water flows and how you tame the futuristic road in your elite sports car - out of time and fuss, among the neon glare and synthwave sounds.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1693040/extras/7feb825d404b7b262a023acf6c8edf19.avif?t=1758407574\" width=616 height=128 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LIST OF GAME ELEMENTS:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 5 playable locations with varied gameplay<br></li><li> 80s neon atmosphere<br></li><li> Various racing tracks<br></li><li> Stunning retrowave / synthwave soundtrack</li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Level 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1693040/852c029675d6e7df0c93ce257c7c1d3d8a9ac43c.jpg"},{"name":"Level 2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1693040/18c65822e7420cfd8bc9fe02e44a4bc77688de62.jpg"},{"name":"Level 3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1693040/5fe1b3814029d111124b052fd52daa2f2dfe11f7.jpg"},{"name":"Level 4","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1693040/4cb2796fed8dd08810e97a852ff1b5349502985e.jpg"},{"name":"Level 5","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1693040/74c67698b0c36861b6e8b133d65e20ec8ba4f87b.jpg"}],"total":5},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1693040?t=1758407574","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1693040/6e059dcb76e7422a319fc08b6ba54c03d44c4902/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758407574","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1693040/9cbca5dcc729fd800123dc0710fff847fccf734a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758407574","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1693040/9cbca5dcc729fd800123dc0710fff847fccf734a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758407574","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"